			],
			"Message": "chore(Dependency): update Queue submodule to latest version\n\nThis updates the Queue dependency to commit ea9daf4, which provides foundational improvements for Land's IPC and process management systems. As part of the Vine IPC layer infrastructure, Queue enhancements likely contribute to:\n- Improved message handling reliability between Mountain and Cocoon processes\n- Better synchronization for extension host RPC operations\n- Preparation for upcoming work on the Cocoon extension host's process lifecycle management\n\nThis dependency update aligns with Land's core goal of maintaining a robust IPC foundation while migrating from Electron to Tauri/Rust architecture.",
